{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/interspersed(with:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"interspersed"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"InterspersedSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Algorithms20InterspersedSequenceV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:ST10AlgorithmsE12interspersed4withAA20InterspersedSequenceVyxG7ElementQz_tF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V","title":"interspersed(with:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"Cliques","relatedModules":["Swift"]}],"symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"Swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"interspersed"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"separator"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Algorithms20InterspersedSequenceV","text":"InterspersedSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sequence.interspersed(with:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/interspersed(with:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"type":"topic","title":"Cliques","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","abstract":[],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"title":"MaximalCliques"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/interspers